<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30315" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγ-κλῐμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>slope</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.59.9
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>inclination, tilt</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ κόσμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hipparch.
					1.3.5
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				6.24
			</span></i>; of an engine, <i><span class="en">
				Bito
				55.10
			</span></i>(pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>latitude</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				316.32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>turning</i>, i. e. <i>rout</i>, of an army, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.19.11
			</span></i>; cj. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκκλημα</span> in <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				20.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Gramm.,
				<i>inflected form</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				83.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>form pronounced with grave accent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				90.12
			</span></i>.</div>
